    ("recipe shortlog release stats", "`shortlog -sne v1.0..v2.0` credits release (contributors!); `--group=trailer` groups (`Co-authored-by`!) — credited (releases!), grouped (trailers!), ranged (versions!)."),
    ("git for docs vale prose", "Docs-as-code (Markdown! `vale` prose lint! `markdownlint` style! link check! preview deploys!) reviews words like code — linted (prose!), previewed (deploys!), reviewed (PRs!)."),
    ("git bare dotfiles home", "Dotfiles bare (`init --bare ~/.cfg`! `alias config`! `checkout`! `status.showUntrackedFiles=no`!) versions home without nesting — bare tracks (home!), untracked hidden (noise out!), aliased (config command!)."),
