    ("git writers chapters review", "Long-form (chapters per file! branches per draft! PRs reviewed! `diff --word-diff` prose!) writes books in git — chapters split (merges!), drafts branched (edits!), words diffed (prose!)."),
    ("teaching git safe undo", "Teaching (small commits! `status` often! branches cheap! `reflog` safety net! clone playgrounds!) builds confidence; mistakes recoverable — committed small (undo easy!), branched (experiments!), reflogged (rescues!)."),
    ("git interview answers workflow", "Interview answers (branch→PR→review→CI→merge! rebase private/merge public! hotfix from tag! revert vs reset!) show judgment; conflicts resolved (rerere!) — workflows narrated (stories!), judgments shown (tradeoffs!), recovery known (reflog!)."),
