    ("vite react setup fast", "Vite (`npm create vite@latest -- --template react`! instant HMR! `vite.config.js` plugins!) starts fast (esbuild pre-bundle!); env `VITE_` prefix (client!) — scaffolded (seconds!), HMR instant (state kept!), env prefixed (exposed!)."),
