    ("polymorphic as prop typing", "Polymorphic `as` (`as?: ElementType`! `ComponentPropsWithoutRef<T>`! ref polymorphic!) types flexible primitives; defaults set — ased dynamic (tags!), proped forwarded (rest!), defaulted button (fallback!)."),
