    ("tsconfig references paths", "Monorepo TS (`references`! `paths: {'@ui/*'}`! `composite`! `tsc -b`!) links packages (editor jumps!); bundler aliases mirror — referenced projects (builds!), pathed aliases (imports!), built composite (fast!)."),
    ("changesets versioning releases", "Changesets (`.md` minor/patch! `changeset version` bumps! CI publish! changelogs!) versions monorepos (per package!); linked groups share versions — changeseted intents (files!), versioned bumps (semver!), published CI (provenance!)."),
    ("storybook stories controls msw", "Storybook (`*.stories.js`! args/controls! MSW addon! `play` interactions! Chromatic visual!) develops isolated (edge cases!); docs auto — storied states (variants!), controlled args (knobs!), played tests (interactions!)."),
    ("fix infinite loop effect", "Effect loops (`setState` in effect with changing dep! `setList([...list])` new ref every render!) fixed by functional updates (`setL(prev => ...)`) or correct deps (primitive ids!) — looped setters (deps!), functionaled updates (prev!), deped primitives (ids!)."),
    ("fix stale closure timeout", "Stale closures (timeouts/intervals capture old state! event handlers frozen!) fixed by refs mirror (`ref.current = state`!) or functional updates; deps arrays include — closed stale (captures!), mirrored refs (current!), updated functional (queues!)."),
    ("fix exhaustive deps warning", "`exhaustive-deps` warnings fixed by adding deps (functions memoized! objects memoized!) or moving inside effect (fetch fns!); disable per-line rarely — deped complete (fresh!), memoized callbacks (stable!), moved inside (locals!)."),
    ("fix useless memo unstable", "`memo` useless when props unstable (inline objects! arrow handlers!) — stabilize first (`useMemo`/`useCallback`!) or drop memo (overhead!); profiler proves — stabilized props (memos work!), dropped premature (cost!), profiled proof (commits!)."),
    ("fix context rerender all", "All consumers rerender on any context change — split contexts (state/actions separate!) or selectors (`useContextSelector`!) or external store (zustand!) — splitted contexts (granular!), selected slices (renders!), stored external (global!)."),
    ("fix strict double effect", "Double effects in dev (StrictMode intentional!) — make effects idempotent (cleanup aborts! guards `ignore` flag!) not delete StrictMode; prod single — idempotented cleanups (aborts!), guarded flags (ignore!), kept strict (bugs surface!)."),
    ("fix batching async updates", "Multiple `setState` batch (one render!); need latest? functional updates chain (`setN(n => n+1)` twice = +2!) or `flushSync` escape (rare!) — batched renders (one!), chained functional (queues!), flushed rarely (sync!)."),
    ("fix derived state antipattern", "State mirroring props desyncs — derive during render (`const full = first + last`!) or `key` remount (user change!) or effect sync (rare documented!) — derived renders (computed!), keyed remounts (fresh!), synced effects (rare!)."),
    ("fix controlled uncontrolled warn", "Switching controlled↔uncontrolled warns — initialize (`useState(value ?? '')`! `defaultValue` xor `value`!) one mode per lifetime; null→'' guards — initialized defined (strings!), XORed modes (one!), guarded nulls (empties!)."),
    ("fix input loses focus remount", "Focus loss means remount (inline component definitions! `key` changes! conditional types swap!) — hoist components (module scope!) stabilize keys (ids!) keep types (same!) — hoisted definitions (stable!), keyed stable (identity!), typed same (no swap!)."),
    ("fix reorder state mismatch", "Reordered inputs keep wrong state — index keys culprit; stable ids fix (db keys!); `key={item.id}` everywhere — IDed stable (reorders!), indexed never (dynamic!), keyed items (identity!)."),
    ("fix fragment key map", "Keys on `<>` impossible — use `<Fragment key={id}>` long form in mapped lists (sections!); shorthand static only — fragmented keyed (long!), mapped lists (keys!), shorted static (no keys!)."),
    ("fix setstate stale queue", "Sequential `setN(n+1); setN(n+1)` yields +1 (same snapshot!) — functional form queues (`setN(p => p+1)` twice = +2!); same for objects — functionaled queues (+2!), snapshotted stale (+1!), queued updates (order!)."),
    ("fix mutate state spread", "Mutating state (`obj.x = 1`! `arr.push`!) skips renders — copy (`{...o, x: 1}`! `[...a, x]`! nested spreads!) or Immer drafts — copied spreads (new refs!), drafted immer (mutable syntax!), nested copied (paths!)."),
    ("fix nested update immer", "Deep updates verbose (`{...s, a: {...s.a, b: {...s.a.b, c}}}}`) — Immer `produce` simplifies (mutable drafts!); normalized flattens (ids!) — produced drafts (mutable!), spread nested (manual!), normalized flat (tables!)."),
    ("fix form rerender keystroke", "Whole form rerenders per keystroke (lifted state! no memo!) — uncontrolled + RHF (refs!) or split components (field-level state!) or debounced — uncontrolled fast (refs!), splitted fields (local!), debounced saves (typing!)."),
    ("fix cursor jump format", "Cursor jumps when formatting controlled inputs (rebuilt value! length changes!) — format onBlur (not change!) or track selection (`setSelectionRange` restore!) — blurred formats (stable!), tracked selection (restore!), changed raw (typing!)."),
    ("fix select value default", "`value` without `onChange` locks select (read-only warn!) — controlled pair (state!) or `defaultValue` uncontrolled; placeholder option (`value=''` disabled!) — paired controlled (state!), defaulted uncontrolled (initial!), optioned placeholder (hints!)."),
    ("fix checkbox group array", "Multi-checkbox binds array (`checked={sel.includes(v)}` toggle add/remove!) not boolean; radio single value — arrayed multi (toggles!), booleaned single (checked!), valued radios (groups!)."),
    ("fix radio checked compare", "Radios need `checked={val === opt}` + shared `name` + `onChange` set; uncontrolled `defaultChecked` once — compared checked (equality!), named groups (exclusive!), changed set (state!)."),
