    ("fix hydration date random", "Mismatches from `Date.now()`/`Math.random()`/locale differ — render dynamic client-only (`useEffect` mount gate! `suppressHydrationWarning` text!) or deterministic SSR — gated mounts (client!), warned suppress (text!), determined server (same!)."),
    ("fix window undefined ssr", "`window`/`document`/`localStorage` crash SSR — guard (`typeof window !== 'undefined'`!) or effect-only (mount!) or dynamic import `ssr:false` — guarded typeof (server!), effected mounts (client!), imported dynamic (islands!)."),
    ("fix layouteffect ssr warn", "`useLayoutEffect` warns on server (no-op!) — `useIsomorphicLayoutEffect` pattern (client layout! server effect!) silences; measure client-only — isomorphic switches (env!), measured client (DOM!), silenced warns (SSR!)."),
    ("fix localstorage ssr init", "Reading storage during SSR crashes — lazy `useState(() => read())` client (mounts!) or try/catch guards; JSON parse failures default — lazied init (mount!), guarded try (parse!), defaulted fallback (corrupt!)."),
    ("fix matchmedia ssr default", "`matchMedia` absent server — default snapshot (`getServerSnapshot: () => false`!) + `useSyncExternalStore` hydrates; CSS first — defaulted server (snapshot!), synced external (store!), CSSed first (styles!)."),
    ("fix title ssr helmet", "Title flashes on SSR nav — Next `metadata` per route (server!) or Helmet async (deferred!); loading states title too — metadataed routes (server!), helmeted async (client!), titled loads (states!)."),
    ("fix suspense stuck fallback", "Stuck fallback = promise never settles (missing await! thrown non-promise! cache miss loop!) — `use()` cached promises (deduped!) + error boundary sibling — settled promises (resolve!), cached dedupe (requests!), bounded errors (siblings!)."),
    ("fix lazy default interop", "`lazy()` needs default export — named? re-export (`export default`) or wrapper module (`{ default } from named`!); types `LazyExoticComponent` — defaulted exports (lazy!), wrapped named (interop!), typed exotic (TS!)."),
    ("fix boundary reset keys", "Boundary stays crashed after fix — `resetKeys={[userId]}` + `onReset` remounts (fresh try!); location key (routes!) — keyed resets (retry!), reset callbacks (state!), located routes (nav!)."),
    ("fix boundary misses events", "Boundaries miss event handlers/async (only render/lifecycle!) — try/catch + local error state (`setErr`! throw in render to trigger!) — caught handlers (try!), stated errors (local!), thrown renders (trigger!)."),
