    ("fix chunk load version skew", "Chunk 404s after deploy (old HTML! new hashes!) — retry once (`window.location.reload`! error boundary reset!) + long cache immutable; service worker updates — retried reloads (fresh!), hashed immutable (cache!), versioned deploys (atomic!)."),
