    ("fix env undefined client", "Client env undefined — prefix required (`VITE_`! `NEXT_PUBLIC_`!) + restart dev (loaded once!) + rebuild (baked!); server secrets unprefixed — prefixed expose (clients!), restarted loads (dev!), baked builds (static!)."),
    ("fix cors fetch proxy", "CORS blocks (`No 'Access-Control-Allow-Origin'`!) — server headers (credentials+origin!) or dev proxy (`vite server.proxy`! Next rewrites!) or same-origin route handlers — headered server (CORS!), proxied dev (rewrites!), routed same-origin (handlers!)."),
    ("fix image 404 base path", "Images 404 on subpath deploys — `basePath`/`assetPrefix` set (Next!) + absolute `/img` breaks (relative!); `loader` custom (CDN!) — pathed base (subpaths!), prefixed assets (CDN!), loaded custom (hosts!)."),
    ("fix font fout cls", "Font swap shifts layout (FOUT/CLS!) — `font-display: optional` + preload + fallback metrics (`size-adjust`!) match; self-host (no CDN!) — displayed swap (text!), preloaded critical (early!), adjusted metrics (fallback!)."),
    ("fix lcp hero priority", "Slow LCP (hero lazy! unsized! unprioritized!) — `priority` + `fetchpriority='high'` + preload + sized (no shift!); CDN serve — prioritized heroes (fetch!), sized boxes (CLS!), preloaded critical (discovery!)."),
    ("fix cls skeleton size", "Layout shift from late content (images! ads! fonts!) — reserve space (aspect-ratio! skeletons same size! dimensions!) CLS < 0.1 — reserved ratios (boxes!), skeletoned same (placeholders!), dimensioned media (attrs!)."),
