    ("fix moment lodash bloat", "Bundle bloated (moment locales! `lodash` full! barrel icons!) — `date-fns`/`dayjs` replace + `lodash-es` named + deep icon imports — replaced light (date!), named cherry (tree-shake!), deep imported (icons!)."),
    ("fix barrel icon imports", "Barrel (`import {X} from 'lib'`) pulls all — deep paths (`lib/X`!) or per-icon packages; analyzer verifies — pathed deep (singles!), barreled never (all!), analyzed proof (treemap!)."),
    ("fix parent rerender memo", "Memo child still renders (parent recreates props! context changed! key changed!) — stable props (callbacks!) + split (state down!) + why-did-you-render — stabled callbacks (equal!), splitted state (local!), diagnosed WDYR (cause!)."),
    ("fix inline object props", "Inline objects (`style={{...}}`! `options={{}}`!) break memo every render — hoist constants (module!) or `useMemo` (deps!) — hoisted constants (stable!), memoized deps (fresh!), inlined never (memo!)."),
    ("fix context object literal", "`value={{user, setUser}}` new ref each render — memoize (`useMemo(() => ({...}), [user])`!) or split; provider up high — memoized values (stable!), splitted providers (scope!), hoisted state (down!)."),
    ("fix selector rerender redux", "Selector rerenders (new object refs! `useSelector(s => s.a.b)` granular! `shallowEqual`!) — selected granular (leaves!), equalled shallow (objects!), memoized reselect (derived!)."),
