    ("fix query key unstable", "Refetch loops from object keys (`['t', {f}]` new ref!) — primitive keys (`['t', f]`!) + stable arrays + `queryKeyHashFn` custom — keyed primitives (stable!), arrayed order (params!), hashed custom (objects!)."),
    ("fix mutation stale invalidate", "UI stale post-mutation (cache untouched!) — `onSuccess: invalidateQueries` (keys!) or optimistic `setQueryData` + rollback — invalidated keys (refetch!), setted optimistic (instant!), rolled back errors (truth!)."),
