    ("fix fetch race abort", "Race (slow earlier overwrites later!) — `AbortController` per effect (cleanup aborts!) or ignore-if-stale (`id` compare!) — aborted cleanups (cancels!), IDed requests (latest!), ignored stale (guards!)."),
