    ("jsonschema validation rules", "`$jsonSchema: {required:[], properties: {age: {bsonType:'int', minimum:0}}}` enforces (inserts+updates!); `validationAction: error|warn` — JSONed schemas (shapes!), typed BSON (fields!), actioned error (rejects!)."),
