    ("group accumulators sum avg", "`$group` accumulators (`$sum`! `$avg`! `$min/$max`! `$push`! `$addToSet`! `$first/$last` sorted!) summarize; `_id: null` whole — summed counts (totals!), averaged means (stats!), pushed arrays (lists!)."),
