    ("video autoplay muted", "Autoplay requires `muted` (+ `playsinline` on iOS) — background loops allowed, noisy autoplay blocked everywhere."),
    ("audio preload", "`preload='none/metadata/auto'` trades startup data (`metadata` default-ish) — long podcasts default `none` with explicit play."),
