    ("focus visible", "`:focus-visible` styles keyboard focus (mouse clicks stay clean) — never remove outlines without replacement rings."),
    ("contrast text", "4.5:1 body text, 3:1 large/UI (WCAG AA) — placeholder text notoriously fails; test with real tools, not eyes."),
    ("reduced motion html", "Honor `prefers-reduced-motion` (disable autoplay/parallax via media query) — vestibular safety is a markup-adjacent duty."),
    ("lang dir mix", "`lang='ar' dir='rtl'` flips layout direction (logical CSS properties adapt); `dir='auto'` per user-generated paragraph — mixed content correct."),
