    ("java spring boot intro", "`@SpringBootApplication\npublic class App { public static void main(String[] args) { SpringApplication.run(App.class, args); } }` (!) — auto-config + embedded server (!) — starter dependencies (!) — the framework ecosystem (DI! web! data!)."),
