    ("java jvm architecture", "ClassLoader (loads!) -> bytecode verifier -> interpreter + JIT (C1/C2!) -> runtime (heap! stacks! metaspace!) (!) — JIT hot-path compilation (fast after warmup!) (!) — the platform mental model."),
    ("java class loading", "Loading -> linking (verify/prepare/resolve!) -> initialization (!) — parent-first delegation (!) — one Class per loader per name (!) — Class.forName vs loader.loadClass (!) — the loading rules."),
