    ("java gc tuning flags", "`-Xms512m -Xmx2g` (fixed = no resize pauses!) `-XX:+UseZGC! -XX:MaxGCPauseMillis=100` (!) — set Xms = Xmx in containers (!) — measure before tuning (GC logs!) (!)."),
