    ("java async profiler", "`async-profiler: ./profiler.sh -d 30 -f out.html <pid>` (!) — sampling with flame graphs (CPU + allocations + locks!) (!) — low overhead (safe in prod!) — the modern favorite (!)."),
    ("java jmh benchmark", "`@Benchmark public void parse() { ! }` -> `mvn package && java -jar benchmarks.jar` (!) — the JMH harness (warmup! forks! statistics!) (!) — NEVER naive System.nanoTime loops (JIT eats them!) (!)."),
