    ("java readwritelock", "`ReentrantReadWriteLock rw = new ReentrantReadWriteLock();\nrw.readLock().lock();\nrw.writeLock().lock();` (!) — readers parallel! writer exclusive (!) — read-mostly data (caches!) (!) — or StampedLock (optimistic reads — advanced!) (!)."),
