    ("rust channels mpsc", "`let (tx, rx) = mpsc::channel();\nthread::spawn(move || { tx.send(1).unwrap(); });\nlet v = rx.recv().unwrap();` (!) — message passing (ownership moves through!) (!) — multiple producers single consumer (!) — sync_channel bounded (below!)."),
