    ("rust streams", "`Stream` = async iterators (`while let Some(x) = stream.next().await`) (!) — futures::StreamExt adapters (!) — tokio_stream for wrappers (!) — the async pipeline."),
    ("rust async channels tokio", "`let (tx, mut rx) = tokio::sync::mpsc::channel(100);\ntx.send(v).await?;\nwhile let Some(x) = rx.recv().await { ! }` (!) — async-aware queues (backpressure!) (!) — oneshot for single reply (!) — broadcast/watch variants (!)."),
