    ("rust sqlx intro", "`sqlx::query_as::<_, User>(\"SELECT ! FROM users WHERE id = $1\").bind(id).fetch_one(&pool).await?` (!) — async SQL (compile-time checked! with macros!) (!) — no DSL (SQL first!) (!)."),
