    ("perl sed style", "`perl -pe 's/foo/bar/g' file! perl -0777 -pe 's/START.*?END//gs' file` (!) — -p print loop! -0777 slurp (!) — -i in-place (!) — the sed replacement (!)."),
    ("perl tr operator", "`$s =~ tr/a-z/A-Z/;! my $count = ($s =~ tr/,/,/);`! `$s =~ tr/aeiou//d;` (delete!) (!) — char mapping not regex (!) — count via tr // return (!)."),
