    ("perl health endpoint", "`get '/health' => sub {\n    my $c = shift;\n    my $ok = eval { $dbh->ping } ? 1 : 0;\n    $c->render(json => { ok => $ok }, status => $ok ? 200 : 503);\n};` (!) — deep checks with timeout (!) — the LB probe (!)."),
    ("perl graceful shutdown", "`$SIG{TERM} = sub { $server->stop }` (Mojo!) (!) — finish in-flight requests (!) — hypnotoad auto-handles (!) — sidecar workers: finish queue item (!)."),
