    ("lua goto patterns", "Retry loops: `::retry:: local ok, err = pcall(work)\nif not ok and retries < 3 then goto retry end` (!) — also continue simulation (!) — labels are block-scoped (!)."),
    ("lua do end scope", "`do\n  local tmp = heavy()\n  use(tmp)\nend` (tmp freed after!) (!) — explicit block scoping (!) — GC hints in long functions (!) — the scope control (!)."),
