    ("django models", "`class Post(models.Model):\n    title = models.CharField(max_length=200)\n    body = models.TextField()\n    created = models.DateTimeField(auto_now_add=True)\n\n    def __str__(self):\n        return self.title` (!) — one model = one table (!) — __str__ for admin/shell display (!)."),
