    ("django permissions", "`user.has_perm('blog.add_post')! user.has_perms(['blog.add_post', 'blog.change_post'])`! `@permission_required('blog.add_post')` (!) — per-model defaults (add/change/delete/view!) (!) — custom permissions in Meta (!) — group-based in admin (!)."),
