    ("django logout", "Django 5: POST only: `<form method=\"post\" action=\"{% url 'logout' %}\">{% csrf_token %}<button>Keluar</button></form>`! logout(request) in view (!) — GET logout removed (CSRF safety!) (!) — the 2023 change people hit (!)."),
