    ("django pytest", "`pytest.ini` / `pyproject.toml`: `[tool.pytest.ini_options]\nDJANGO_SETTINGS_MODULE = 'mysite.settings'\npython_files = ['tests.py', 'test_*.py']`! run: pytest (!) — plain asserts! parametrize! plugins (!) — the modern runner (!)."),
